WEBVTT

00:11:59.996 --> 00:12:03.956
for those people who choose
and manage judges

00:12:03.956 --> 00:12:09.996
and ultimately better evidence
that those judges deserve your trust.

00:12:11.756 --> 00:12:14.116
And that's what it all comes back to.

00:12:14.916 --> 00:12:18.156
Any of us, any day,

00:12:18.196 --> 00:12:22.396
could find our future
in the hands of a judge.

00:12:23.236 --> 00:12:24.596
In that moment,

00:12:24.636 --> 00:12:28.236
we need to be able
to look each other in the eye

00:12:28.276 --> 00:12:31.036
and know we can trust the system.